  "description": "XADLUJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H117 La5 O14,2(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2A (La) has 6 O neighbors; La3A (La) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.646-5.187 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.25-171.73°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La5(μ5-O)(μ3-OtBu)4(μ-OtBu)4(OtBu)5]·2THF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
